<pdd-reason>The GUI's build_mix calls compose_mix_plan IN-PROCESS against the module-level MIX_PLAN_PATH, so adding a --plan flag to build_mix_plan.py would never reach it and the Arrange tab would be permanently empty.</pdd-reason>
